@format 1
@id queue.remove-work
@title Remove work record
@area 4. Queue and scheduling
@entry input
@summary The selected work item no longer exists in the worklist.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related queue.load
@tag queue
@tag remove-work

@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Remove work record request <input>
- Receive the selected work identifier or live work item @ schedule.LScheduleRemove(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply durable transition <decision>
- Delete every durable record for the work identifier, update the index, and reload the schedule @ schedule.LScheduleRemove(...)
? "Durable transition succeeds" > result
? "Record is absent or storage transition fails" > failed

[result] Schedule changed <output>
=The selected work item no longer exists in the worklist.

[failed] Transition failed <error>
= Existing durable work state remains authoritative.
